<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained an oil spill in Mariveles, Bataan and removed 800 kg of contaminated debris, while the navy is probing a reservist's social media post that incited violence in Manila. China warned it could cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines and increased patrols near Taiwan, raising maritime tension, and a Chinese survey vessel entered Scarborough Shoal with unidentified equipment. The Coast Guard deployed its flagship BRP Teresa Magbanua to southeastern Mindanao to intensify maritime patrols and deter illegal activities, and a nationwide earthquake drill tested tsunami preparedness in Cagayan. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPVXVHSHFLWkpFLXktV1MxdXc0anl6WW1jWURGYUlKYTY1YU1iTXpaWm1welFzM1c0S1RIZm1CUk9ZU29WN2sxOGF2N0h5ekV3NF91UGNTUWdjRGZVUEJpVmU1bGkwN1FEeEM2dTNkZHhfckxTbWhocmYwQ2dkVDhnTkdiX0hwd2k4VDFLd0NsNzk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNNEpoZV9wenZEWlllajlYRzdfdGgzVjJXc1ZLX3dIbEduS1dTMXp3cWtNak82SzNfS3o5YlRXNENZWXlseFc1RTBIWkh6Y2pjTThJaTA4WlNWQVE1Wms2eU4xcUVNdTlILTRiQ3oxNElRX1FMSjlXU0c2U2xCbFVYNk1oV2NyZ3U0V3lLNzR4LU1waWNMS0w2Q3ZDbko?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPVURSVFZDLTQxRzhESGZRaUgxSHp1TVBtSmNuMEVUam5vSl9XZTMxVm5tRlJUbGZiMFNjMjMxSGlxSnNUYUtOUTcta3F3aHd2VjczOFV3TEI2NzdMNFVjRUhJMjhFN01ocDhUNHBiNDkweUhNQkhjMnVrVmxiNTJiTmxTbmpZR3FpUUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quo